        To achieve <strong>sub-8ms p95 latency</strong> with pgvector on 5M+ vectors, build an <strong>HNSW index</strong> with <code>m = 16, ef_construction = 128</code>, allocate at least <code>maintenance_work_mem = 8GB</code> for index builds, and set runtime search depth to <code>SET hnsw.ef_search = 100</code> for 99.2% recall accuracy.
      </p>
